<title>USA: Greyhound completes Carolina Trailways buy.</title>
<headline>Greyhound completes Carolina Trailways buy.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greyhound Lines Inc said Wednesday it had completed its acquisition of Carolina Trailways Inc of Raleigh, North Carolina.</p>
<p>Greyhound paid total consideration of about $25.2 million for the privately held company, which provides intercity bus service in the Mid-Atlantic region.</p>
